WEBVTT

00:00:21.586 --> 00:00:22.629
Aslan.

00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:26.842
Welcome, children.
You have done well.

00:00:26.925 --> 00:00:29.011
Very well indeed.

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:33.473
You have come far,
and now your journey is at its end.

00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:35.475
Is this your country?

00:00:35.559 --> 00:00:38.145
No, my country lies beyond.

00:00:41.398 --> 00:00:43.191
Is my father in your country?

00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:46.611
You can only find that out
for yourself, my son.

00:00:47.571 --> 00:00:49.990
But you should know
that if you continue,

00:00:50.073 --> 00:00:51.575
there is no return.

00:01:24.358 --> 00:01:25.901
You're not going?

00:01:25.984 --> 00:01:27.903
I can't imagine my father
would be very proud

00:01:27.986 --> 00:01:30.072
that I gave up what he died for.

00:01:33.158 --> 00:01:36.536
I spent too long wanting what was
taken from me and not what was given.

00:01:37.871 --> 00:01:39.539
I was given a kingdom.

00:01:41.124 --> 00:01:42.292
A people.

00:01:48.757 --> 00:01:50.884
I promise to be a better king.

00:01:50.967 --> 00:01:52.969
You already are.

00:01:54.596 --> 00:01:55.889
Children.

00:01:56.765 --> 00:01:59.685
I think perhaps it's time
we went home, actually, Lu.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.022
But I thought you loved it here.

00:02:04.106 --> 00:02:05.941
I do.

00:02:06.024 --> 00:02:09.319
But I love home and our family as well.

00:02:11.988 --> 00:02:13.573
They need us.

00:02:15.826 --> 00:02:17.369
(Reepicheep clears his throat)

00:02:21.665 --> 00:02:24.918
Your Eminence,
ever since I can remember,

00:02:25.002 --> 00:02:27.379
I have dreamt of seeing your country.

00:02:27.462 --> 00:02:30.465
I've had many great adventures
in this world,

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:33.593
but nothing has dampened
that yearning.

00:02:34.302 --> 00:02:36.054
I know I am hardly worthy,

00:02:36.138 --> 00:02:40.142
but with your permission,
I would lay down my sword

00:02:40.225 --> 00:02:44.813
for the joy of seeing
your country with my own eyes.

00:02:48.275 --> 00:02:52.571
My country was made for
noble hearts such as yours,

00:02:52.654 --> 00:02:55.407
no matter how small
their bearers be.

00:02:56.116 --> 00:02:57.117
Your Majesty.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.827
No one could be more deserving.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.620
-Well, I...
-EDMUND: It's true.

00:03:14.134 --> 00:03:15.677
May I?

00:03:16.636 --> 00:03:19.890
Well, I suppose.
Just this... ooh!

00:03:19.973 --> 00:03:21.683
(anxious chuckle)

00:03:25.354 --> 00:03:26.605
Goodbye, Lucy.

00:03:42.537 --> 00:03:44.498
Don't cry.

00:03:44.581 --> 00:03:46.500
I don't understand.

00:03:49.086 --> 00:03:50.962
Will I not see you again?

00:03:51.046 --> 00:03:52.422
Ever?

00:03:52.506 --> 00:03:55.509
What a magnificent puzzle you are...

00:03:55.592 --> 00:03:57.177
and a true hero.

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:01.306
It has been my honor to fight
beside such a brave warrior...

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.058
and a great friend.

00:04:15.362 --> 00:04:17.114
I won't be needing this.

00:04:44.933 --> 00:04:47.227
This is our last time here, isn't it?

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:51.231
Yes. You have grown up, my dear one.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.401
Just like Peter and Susan.

00:04:54.484 --> 00:04:56.528
Will you visit us in our world?

00:04:57.487 --> 00:05:00.157
I shall be watching you, always.

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:04.161
How?

00:05:04.661 --> 00:05:07.914
In your world, I have another name.

00:05:07.998 --> 00:05:10.292
You must learn to know me by it.

00:05:10.375 --> 00:05:13.670
That was the very reason
you were brought to Narnia.

00:05:13.754 --> 00:05:16.465
That by knowing me here for a little,

00:05:16.548 --> 00:05:18.884
you may know me better there.

00:05:19.801 --> 00:05:21.636
Will we meet again?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.598
Mm... yes, dear one.

00:05:24.681 --> 00:05:26.391
One day.

00:05:28.018 --> 00:05:29.770
(roars)

00:05:41.448 --> 00:05:43.742
You're the closest thing I have to family.

00:05:46.036 --> 00:05:48.372
And that includes you, Eustace.

00:05:48.455 --> 00:05:49.915
(quiet laugh)

00:05:49.998 --> 00:05:51.500
Thank you.

00:06:06.098 --> 00:06:07.766
(sobbing softly)

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.196
Will I come back?

00:06:21.279 --> 00:06:24.491
Narnia may yet have need of you.

